      "entries": [
        "The spirit naga casts one of the following spells, requiring only verbal components and using CHA as the spellcasting ability (spell save DC 14).<br>At will: _command_, _mage hand_, _minor illusion_<br>3/day each: _augury_ (as an action), _charm_, _sleep_<br>2/day each: _bestow curse_, _hold_<br>1/day: _dominate_"
